    "description": "Finding a home \ud83c\udfe0 in the Middle East has never been easier than with Property Finder. \r\n<b>Whether you're buying or renting, you want a villa or a flat, we have it all.</b>\r\n\r\nProperty Finder searches properties throughout the <b>UAE (Dubai, Abu Dhabi...), Bahrain, Qatar, Egypt, and Saudi Arabia</b> and includes English and Arabic support. With homes and commercial real estate available, including apartments, flats, studios, villas, townhouses, penthouses, as well as plots of land, offices \ud83c\udfe2 and shops, we'll help you find exactly what you're looking for. And when you do, Property Finder puts you in contact with the real estate agent via phone, SMS, email, or WhatsApp.\r\n\r\nDon't see what you're looking for? No problem! Take the stress out of searching by letting the Property Finder app do it for you. Saved searches remember your requirements and will notify you when a property that matches them becomes available for sale. We'll make sure you never miss that perfect property again.\r\n\r\n<b>HOME SEARCH APP FEATURES</b>\r\nOur Properties App is full of features that are designed to take the hassle out of finding residential or commercial real estate, whether that's a new home or somewhere to start a business. \r\nSome of those features include:\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>Properties Filters \ud83d\udd0e and Maps</b> that make it easier to weed out the properties that don't meet your needs while highlighting those that do. Filters include the number of bedrooms \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f, bathrooms \ud83d\udec1, price, location, and much more.\r\n\u2022 <b>Saved Searches \u2764\ufe0f</b> that take criteria from your filtered property searches and save them for future use\u2014and we'll even send you a notification when a property matching your needs is listed.\r\n\u2022 <b>Super Agents \ud83c\udf1f</b> A Super Agent is a super-qualified real estate agent working for a real estate company or agency who will provide you with an easy and hassle-free home-seeking journey. This feature is only available in UAE.\r\n\u2022 <b>Verified Listings \u2705 </b> Verified property listings ensure that the pictures you\u2019re browsing on the Property Finder app is the same as the property, with predefined verification steps done for you.\r\n\u2022 <b>Quick and easy ways to get the ball rolling.</b> See a property you like? Get in touch with the real estate agent directly via phone, SMS, WhatsApp, or email without hunting for their contact details online.\r\n\r\n<b>TYPES OF PROPERTY LISTINGS</b>\r\nProperty Finder helps you find the best residential or commercial properties in Dubai and other cities. Find <b>real estate near you</b> in every community or emirate including:\r\nBuy, rent, or invest in the real estate market with Property Finder:\r\n\u2713 Studios, Flats & Apartments (1 BHK, 2 BHK,...), Duplexes, Penthouses,\r\n\u2713 Villas & Townhouses, Compounds,\r\n\u2713 Lands & Plots,\r\n\u2713 Commercial Properties (Offices, Warehouses, Shops, Buildings),\r\n\u2713 Short-Term and Long-Term Home Rentals,\r\n\u2713 Furnished or Unfurnished Properties\r\n\u2713 Off-plan properties, New Projects & Developments\r\n\r\nFind great investment opportunities in the housing sector, whether for ready-to-move-in properties or a long-term investment. See our huge portfolio of properties built or off-plan for sale from top developers such as Emaar, Damac, Nakheel, Danube...\r\n\r\nProperty Finder, Your House Finder, helps you to find the best property from developers and real estate companies or agencies.\r\n\r\nAnd that's just the start! You can download the app for free and learn more about Property Finder:\r\n\u2713 UAE \ud83c\udde6\ud83c\uddea: <a>https://www.propertyfinder.ae</a>\r\n\u2713 Egypt \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddec: <a>https://www.propertyfinder.eg</a>\r\n\u2713 Qatar \ud83c\uddf6\ud83c\udde6: <a>https://www.propertyfinder.qa</a>\r\n\u2713 Saudi Arabia \ud83c\uddf8\ud83c\udde6: <a>https://www.propertyfinder.sa</a>\r